From 30 October 2026, the question bank (bank/ and verification/) is kept in a private
repository and is not licensed for reuse. The questions shown on epsokviz.dravec.org may be
read and quoted for personal study. Copying, scraping or republishing them, in whole or in
part, needs written permission.

Versions of the bank published in this repository before 30 October 2026 (data/bank/,
data/questions.json, data/verification/) were released under CC BY-NC-SA 4.0. That licence
cannot be withdrawn for those copies, so anyone who received them keeps the rights it gives
them. It does not extend to questions or changes made after that date.

Still under CC BY-NC-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/4.0/legalcode):
the public sample in data/sample/ (30 questions already published under that licence),
data/meta.json, the verbal items in data/verbal/ and the study guide in src/content/. You may
copy and adapt them for non-commercial use if you credit "EPSO AI Field Trainer
(epsokviz.dravec.org)" and share your adaptations under the same licence. Commercial use
needs written permission.

Not covered: the public source texts in data/sources/. Each keeps its own terms
(EU texts under Commission Decision 2011/833/EU, NIST works in the US public domain,
the International AI Safety Report under the Open Government Licence v3.0, and
others): see data/sources/LICENSES.md. The quotes in the bank are taken from them.
